. Not editorial judgement - and rule 7 asks whether *you* can explain it, so rewrite this in your own words before you rely on it."},"bull":[{"text":"Growth has been positive in all 8 year-on-year comparisons, so this is a trend rather than one good quarter.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1795139/000119312526071672/0001193125-26-071672-index.htm","accession":"0001193125-26-071672"},{"text":"Operating cash flow is positive at $308.8m over the trailing year, so the business funds itself and is not dependent on raising money.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1795139/000119312526209127/0001193125-26-209127-index.htm","accession":"0001193125-26-209127"},{"text":"Net cash of $97.2m against total assets of $2.8bn - no debt overhang forcing decisions.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1795139/000119312526209127/0001193125-26-209127-index.htm","accession":"0001193125-26-209127"},{"text":"Share count is close to flat (-2.1% over the year), so growth in the business accrues to existing holders rather than being diluted away.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1795139/000119312526209127/0001193125-26-209127-index.htm","accession":"0001193125-26-209127"}],"bear":[{"text":"Officers and directors hold only 1.1% of the shares. There is little alignment between what happens to the share price and what happens to them.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1795139/000195036726000004/0001950367-26-000004-index.htm"},{"text":"Base rate: 57.8% of US common stocks underperformed one-month Treasury bills over their lifetimes (Bessembinder, Journal of Financial Economics, 2018). Nothing above changes that starting point.","source_url":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jfineco.2018.06.004"}],"triggers":[{"id":"growth_floor","kind":"metric","label":"Revenue growth falls below -9.0% for 2 consecutive quarters","metric":"revenue_growth_yoy","comparison":"below","threshold":-0.09,"consecutive":2,"cu